{"id":"[REDACTED]","object":"chat.completion","created":1790942037,"model":"mercury-2","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"record_type\": \"reduction\",\n  \"summary\": \"The review of the Mercury bridge repository identified a mix of confirmed mechanical issues, substantive behavior changes, extensive unresolved evidence due to incomplete AST fragments, malformed mapper shards, and several areas where no defects were found. Key mechanical findings include a silent default in optionalEnvBoolean and multiple added throw statements. A substantive change removes the Opus fallback in provider-preflight, reducing provider coverage. Numerous mapper shards are malformed or incomplete, leaving many code regions unverified. Inherited risk categories (|| 0, swallowed catch, bypass env, silent default) are present across the codebase. A large number of files were examined with no defects reported, and blast‑radius metadata confirms no issues for those components. Several shards have missing acknowledgments and outstanding unit IDs, indicating gaps in evidence collection.\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"target\": \"trai_brain/mercury-bridge/config.js\",\n      \"status\": \"mechanical_f\",\n      \"evidence\": \"optionalEnvBoolean returns false silently for unrecognized environment values (lines 81‑87).\",\n      \"classification\": \"MECHANICAL\",\n      \"basis\": \"RECEIPT\",\n      \"resolution\": \"UNRESOLVED\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"target\": \"trai_brain/mercury-bridge/provider-preflight.js\",\n      \"status\": \"substantive finding\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Removal of legacy Fable client and Opus fallback logic (lines 232‑246, 118‑124).\",\n      \"classification\": \"SUBSTANTIVE\",\n      \"basis\": \"RECEIPT\",\n      \"resolution\": \"UNRESOLVED\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"target\": \"trai_brain/mercury-bridge/adversarial-review.js\",\n      \"status\": \"added throw statements\",\n      \"evidence\": \"throw new Error('Kimi fi